{"route":"/docs/4.1/components/carousel/","version":"4.1","renderedVersion":"4.1","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Carousel","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"A slideshow component for cycling through elements—images or slides of text—like a carousel."},"blocks":[{"id":"how-it-works","type":"heading","en":"How it works","level":2},{"id":"how-it-works--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"The carousel is a slideshow for cycling through a series of content, built with CSS 3D transforms and a bit of JavaScript. It works with a series of images, text, or custom markup. It also includes support for previous/next controls and indicators."},{"id":"how-it-works--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"In browsers where the <a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/page-visibility/\">Page Visibility API</a> is supported, the carousel will avoid sliding when the webpage is not visible to the user (such as when the browser tab is inactive, the browser window is minimized, etc.)."},{"id":"how-it-works--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"Please be aware that nested carousels are not supported, and carousels are generally not compliant with accessibility standards."},{"id":"how-it-works--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":"Lastly, if you’re building our JavaScript from source, it <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.1/getting-started/javascript/#util\">requires <code>util.js</code></a>."},{"id":"example","type":"heading","en":"Example","level":2},{"id":"example--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Carousels don’t automatically normalize slide dimensions. As such, you may need to use additional utilities or custom styles to appropriately size content. While carousels support previous/next controls and indicators, they’re not explicitly required. Add and customize as you see fit."},{"id":"example--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"<strong>The <code>.active</code> class needs to be added to one of the slides</strong> otherwise the carousel will not be visible. Also be sure to set a unique id on the <code>.carousel</code> for optional controls, especially if you’re using multiple carousels on a single page. Control and indicator elements must have a <code>data-target</code> attribute (or <code>href</code> for links) that matches the id of the <code>.carousel</code> element."},{"id":"slides-only","type":"heading","en":"Slides only","level":3},{"id":"slides-only--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Here’s a carousel with slides only. Note the presence of the <code>.d-block</code> and <code>.w-100</code> on carousel images to prevent browser default image alignment."},{"id":"slides-only--example-1","type":"demo","key":"e77b5f4ab029755fd7a7","height":300,"anchors":["carouselExampleSlidesOnly"]},{"id":"slides-only--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div id=\"carouselExampleSlidesOnly\" class=\"carousel slide\" data-ride=\"carousel\">\n  <div class=\"carousel-inner\">\n    <div class=\"carousel-item active\">\n      <img class=\"d-block w-100\" src=\".../800x400?auto=yes&bg=777&fg=555&text=First slide\" alt=\"First slide\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"carousel-item\">\n      <img class=\"d-block w-100\" src=\".../800x400?auto=yes&bg=666&fg=444&text=Second slide\" alt=\"Second slide\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"carousel-item\">\n      <img class=\"d-block w-100\" src=\".../800x400?auto=yes&bg=555&fg=333&text=Third slide\" alt=\"Third slide\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"with-controls","type":"heading","en":"With controls","level":3},{"id":"with-controls--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Adding in the previous and next controls:"},{"id":"with-controls--example-1","type":"demo","key":"ab6db1311cb57c730078","height":300,"anchors":["carouselExampleControls"]},{"id":"with-controls--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div id=\"carouselExampleControls\" class=\"carousel slide\" data-ride=\"carousel\">\n  <div class=\"carousel-inner\">\n    <div class=\"carousel-item active\">\n      <img class=\"d-block w-100\" src=\".../800x400?auto=yes&bg=777&fg=555&text=First slide\" alt=\"First slide\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"carousel-item\">\n      <img class=\"d-block w-100\" src=\".../800x400?auto=yes&bg=666&fg=444&text=Second slide\" alt=\"Second slide\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"carousel-item\">\n      <img class=\"d-block w-100\" src=\".../800x400?auto=yes&bg=555&fg=333&text=Third slide\" alt=\"Third slide\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <a class=\"carousel-control-prev\" href=\"#carouselExampleControls\" role=\"button\" data-slide=\"prev\">\n    <span class=\"carousel-control-prev-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n    <span class=\"sr-only\">Previous</span>\n  </a>\n  <a class=\"carousel-control-next\" href=\"#carouselExampleControls\" role=\"button\" data-slide=\"next\">\n    <span class=\"carousel-control-next-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n    <span class=\"sr-only\">Next</span>\n  </a>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"with-indicators","type":"heading","en":"With indicators","level":3},{"id":"with-indicators--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"You can also add the indicators to the carousel, alongside the controls, too."},{"id":"with-indicators--example-1","type":"demo","key":"23b8cdff60e4b758cc7a","height":300,"anchors":["carouselExampleIndicators"]},{"id":"with-indicators--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div id=\"carouselExampleIndicators\" class=\"carousel slide\" data-ride=\"carousel\">\n  <ol class=\"carousel-indicators\">\n    <li data-target=\"#carouselExampleIndicators\" data-slide-to=\"0\" class=\"active\"></li>\n    <li data-target=\"#carouselExampleIndicators\" data-slide-to=\"1\"></li>\n    <li data-target=\"#carouselExampleIndicators\" data-slide-to=\"2\"></li>\n  </ol>\n  <div class=\"carousel-inner\">\n    <div class=\"carousel-item active\">\n      <img class=\"d-block w-100\" src=\".../800x400?auto=yes&bg=777&fg=555&text=First slide\" alt=\"First slide\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"carousel-item\">\n      <img class=\"d-block w-100\" src=\".../800x400?auto=yes&bg=666&fg=444&text=Second slide\" alt=\"Second slide\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"carousel-item\">\n      <img class=\"d-block w-100\" src=\".../800x400?auto=yes&bg=555&fg=333&text=Third slide\" alt=\"Third slide\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <a class=\"carousel-control-prev\" href=\"#carouselExampleIndicators\" role=\"button\" data-slide=\"prev\">\n    <span class=\"carousel-control-prev-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n    <span class=\"sr-only\">Previous</span>\n  </a>\n  <a class=\"carousel-control-next\" href=\"#carouselExampleIndicators\" role=\"button\" data-slide=\"next\">\n    <span class=\"carousel-control-next-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n    <span class=\"sr-only\">Next</span>\n  </a>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"with-captions","type":"heading","en":"With captions","level":3},{"id":"with-captions--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Add captions to your slides easily with the <code>.carousel-caption</code> element within any <code>.carousel-item</code>. They can be easily hidden on smaller viewports, as shown below, with optional <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.1/utilities/display/\">display utilities</a>. We hide them initially with <code>.d-none</code> and bring them back on medium-sized devices with <code>.d-md-block</code>."},{"id":"with-captions--example-1","type":"demo","key":"25e5260631ae69fd7429","height":300,"anchors":["carouselExampleCaptions"]},{"id":"with-captions--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"carousel-item\">\n  <img src=\"...\" alt=\"...\">\n  <div class=\"carousel-caption d-none d-md-block\">\n    <h5>...</h5>\n    <p>...</p>\n  </div>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"crossfade","type":"heading","en":"Crossfade","level":3},{"id":"crossfade--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Add <code>.carousel-fade</code> to your carousel to animate slides with a fade transition instead of a slide."},{"id":"crossfade--example-1","type":"demo","key":"26ad6eecc1aa67e10366","height":300,"anchors":["carouselExampleFade"]},{"id":"crossfade--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div id=\"carouselExampleFade\" class=\"carousel slide carousel-fade\" data-ride=\"carousel\">\n  <div class=\"carousel-inner\">\n    <div class=\"carousel-item active\">\n      <img class=\"d-block w-100\" src=\".../800x400?auto=yes&bg=777&fg=555&text=First slide\" alt=\"First slide\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"carousel-item\">\n      <img class=\"d-block w-100\" src=\".../800x400?auto=yes&bg=666&fg=444&text=Second slide\" alt=\"Second slide\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"carousel-item\">\n      <img class=\"d-block w-100\" src=\".../800x400?auto=yes&bg=555&fg=333&text=Third slide\" alt=\"Third slide\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <a class=\"carousel-control-prev\" href=\"#carouselExampleFade\" role=\"button\" data-slide=\"prev\">\n    <span class=\"carousel-control-prev-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n    <span class=\"sr-only\">Previous</span>\n  </a>\n  <a class=\"carousel-control-next\" href=\"#carouselExampleFade\" role=\"button\" data-slide=\"next\">\n    <span class=\"carousel-control-next-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n    <span class=\"sr-only\">Next</span>\n  </a>\n</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"usage","type":"heading","en":"Usage","level":2},{"id":"via-data-attributes","type":"heading","en":"Via data attributes","level":3},{"id":"via-data-attributes--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Use data attributes to easily control the position of the carousel. <code>data-slide</code> accepts the keywords <code>prev</code> or <code>next</code>, which alters the slide position relative to its current position. Alternatively, use <code>data-slide-to</code> to pass a raw slide index to the carousel <code>data-slide-to=&quot;2&quot;</code>, which shifts the slide position to a particular index beginning with <code>0</code>."},{"id":"via-data-attributes--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"The <code>data-ride=&quot;carousel&quot;</code> attribute is used to mark a carousel as animating starting at page load. <strong>It cannot be used in combination with (redundant and unnecessary) explicit JavaScript initialization of the same carousel.</strong>"},{"id":"via-javascript","type":"heading","en":"Via JavaScript","level":3},{"id":"via-javascript--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Call carousel manually with:"},{"id":"via-javascript--code-1","type":"code","value":"$('.carousel').carousel()","language":"js"},{"id":"options","type":"heading","en":"Options","level":3},{"id":"options--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Options can be passed via data attributes or JavaScript. For data attributes, append the option name to <code>data-</code>, as in <code>data-interval=&quot;&quot;</code>."},{"id":"options--table-1","type":"table","caption":[],"rows":[{"head":true,"cells":[{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Name"}]},{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"Type"}]},{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":"Default"}]},{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-5","type":"paragraph","en":"Description"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-6","type":"paragraph","en":"interval"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-7","type":"paragraph","en":"number"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-8","type":"paragraph","en":"5000"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-9","type":"paragraph","en":"The amount of time to delay between automatically cycling an item. If false, carousel will not automatically cycle."}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-10","type":"paragraph","en":"keyboard"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-11","type":"paragraph","en":"boolean"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-12","type":"paragraph","en":"true"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-13","type":"paragraph","en":"Whether the carousel should react to keyboard events."}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-14","type":"paragraph","en":"pause"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-15","type":"paragraph","en":"string | boolean"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-16","type":"paragraph","en":"&quot;hover&quot;"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-17","type":"paragraph","en":"If set to <code>&quot;hover&quot;</code>, pauses the cycling of the carousel on <code>mouseenter</code> and resumes the cycling of the carousel on <code>mouseleave</code>. If set to <code>false</code>, hovering over the carousel won&#39;t pause it."},{"id":"options--paragraph-18","type":"paragraph","en":"On touch-enabled devices, when set to <code>&quot;hover&quot;</code>, cycling will pause on <code>touchend</code> (once the user finished interacting with the carousel) for two intervals, before automatically resuming. Note that this is in addition to the above mouse behavior."}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-19","type":"paragraph","en":"ride"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-20","type":"paragraph","en":"string"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-21","type":"paragraph","en":"false"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-22","type":"paragraph","en":"Autoplays the carousel after the user manually cycles the first item. If &quot;carousel&quot;, autoplays the carousel on load."}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-23","type":"paragraph","en":"wrap"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-24","type":"paragraph","en":"boolean"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-25","type":"paragraph","en":"true"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"options--paragraph-26","type":"paragraph","en":"Whether the carousel should cycle continuously or have hard stops."}]}]}]},{"id":"methods","type":"heading","en":"Methods","level":3},{"id":"methods--note-1","type":"note","tone":"danger","body":[{"id":"asynchronous-methods-and-transitions","type":"heading","en":"Asynchronous methods and transitions","level":4},{"id":"asynchronous-methods-and-transitions--note-text-1","type":"note-text","en":"All API methods are <strong>asynchronous</strong> and start a <strong>transition</strong>. They return to the caller as soon as the transition is started but <strong>before it ends</strong>. In addition, a method call on a <strong>transitioning component will be ignored</strong>."},{"id":"asynchronous-methods-and-transitions--note-text-2","type":"note-text","en":"<a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.1/getting-started/javascript/\">See our JavaScript documentation for more information.</a>"}]},{"id":"carouseloptions","type":"heading","en":"<code>.carousel(options)</code>","level":4},{"id":"carouseloptions--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Initializes the carousel with an optional options <code>object</code> and starts cycling through items."},{"id":"carouseloptions--code-1","type":"code","value":"$('.carousel').carousel({\n  interval: 2000\n})","language":"js"},{"id":"carouselcycle","type":"heading","en":"<code>.carousel(&#39;cycle&#39;)</code>","level":4},{"id":"carouselcycle--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Cycles through the carousel items from left to right."},{"id":"carouselpause","type":"heading","en":"<code>.carousel(&#39;pause&#39;)</code>","level":4},{"id":"carouselpause--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Stops the carousel from cycling through items."},{"id":"carouselnumber","type":"heading","en":"<code>.carousel(number)</code>","level":4},{"id":"carouselnumber--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Cycles the carousel to a particular frame (0 based, similar to an array). <strong>Returns to the caller before the target item has been shown</strong> (i.e. before the <code>slid.bs.carousel</code> event occurs)."},{"id":"carouselprev","type":"heading","en":"<code>.carousel(&#39;prev&#39;)</code>","level":4},{"id":"carouselprev--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Cycles to the previous item. <strong>Returns to the caller before the previous item has been shown</strong> (i.e. before the <code>slid.bs.carousel</code> event occurs)."},{"id":"carouselnext","type":"heading","en":"<code>.carousel(&#39;next&#39;)</code>","level":4},{"id":"carouselnext--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Cycles to the next item. <strong>Returns to the caller before the next item has been shown</strong> (i.e. before the <code>slid.bs.carousel</code> event occurs)."},{"id":"carouseldispose","type":"heading","en":"<code>.carousel(&#39;dispose&#39;)</code>","level":4},{"id":"carouseldispose--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Destroys an element’s carousel."},{"id":"events","type":"heading","en":"Events","level":3},{"id":"events--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Bootstrap’s carousel class exposes two events for hooking into carousel functionality. Both events have the following additional properties:"},{"id":"events--list-1","type":"list","tag":"ul","items":[{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"events--item-1","type":"item","en":"<code>direction</code>: The direction in which the carousel is sliding (either <code>&quot;left&quot;</code> or <code>&quot;right&quot;</code>)."}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"events--item-2","type":"item","en":"<code>relatedTarget</code>: The DOM element that is being slid into place as the active item."}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"events--item-3","type":"item","en":"<code>from</code>: The index of the current item"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"events--item-4","type":"item","en":"<code>to</code>: The index of the next item"}]}]},{"id":"events--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"All carousel events are fired at the carousel itself (i.e. at the <code>&lt;div class=&quot;carousel&quot;&gt;</code>)."},{"id":"events--table-1","type":"table","caption":[],"rows":[{"head":true,"cells":[{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"events--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"Event Type"}]},{"type":"th","body":[{"id":"events--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":"Description"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"events--paragraph-5","type":"paragraph","en":"slide.bs.carousel"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"events--paragraph-6","type":"paragraph","en":"This event fires immediately when the <code>slide</code> instance method is invoked."}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"events--paragraph-7","type":"paragraph","en":"slid.bs.carousel"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"events--paragraph-8","type":"paragraph","en":"This event is fired when the carousel has completed its slide transition."}]}]}]},{"id":"events--code-1","type":"code","value":"$('#myCarousel').on('slide.bs.carousel', function () {\n  // do something…\n})","language":"js"},{"id":"change-transition-duration","type":"heading","en":"Change transition duration","level":3},{"id":"change-transition-duration--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"The transition duration of <code>.carousel-item</code> can be changed with the <code>$carousel-transition</code> Sass variable before compiling or custom styles if you’re using the compiled CSS. If multiple transitions are applied, make sure the transform transition is defined first (eg. <code>transition: transform 2s ease, opacity .5s ease-out</code>)."}],"demos":[{"key":"e77b5f4ab029755fd7a7","html":"\n<div id=\"carouselExampleSlidesOnly\" class=\"carousel slide\" data-ride=\"carousel\">\n  <div class=\"carousel-inner\">\n    <div class=\"carousel-item active\">\n      <img class=\"d-block w-100\" data-src=\"holder.js/800x400?auto=yes&amp;bg=777&amp;fg=555&amp;text=First slide\" alt=\"First slide\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"carousel-item\">\n      <img class=\"d-block w-100\" data-src=\"holder.js/800x400?auto=yes&amp;bg=666&amp;fg=444&amp;text=Second slide\" alt=\"Second slide\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"carousel-item\">\n      <img class=\"d-block w-100\" data-src=\"holder.js/800x400?auto=yes&amp;bg=555&amp;fg=333&amp;text=Third slide\" alt=\"Third slide\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"ab6db1311cb57c730078","html":"\n<div id=\"carouselExampleControls\" class=\"carousel slide\" data-ride=\"carousel\">\n  <div class=\"carousel-inner\">\n    <div class=\"carousel-item active\">\n      <img class=\"d-block w-100\" data-src=\"holder.js/800x400?auto=yes&amp;bg=777&amp;fg=555&amp;text=First slide\" alt=\"First slide\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"carousel-item\">\n      <img class=\"d-block w-100\" data-src=\"holder.js/800x400?auto=yes&amp;bg=666&amp;fg=444&amp;text=Second slide\" alt=\"Second slide\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"carousel-item\">\n      <img class=\"d-block w-100\" data-src=\"holder.js/800x400?auto=yes&amp;bg=555&amp;fg=333&amp;text=Third slide\" alt=\"Third slide\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <a class=\"carousel-control-prev\" href=\"#carouselExampleControls\" role=\"button\" data-slide=\"prev\">\n    <span class=\"carousel-control-prev-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n    <span class=\"sr-only\">Previous</span>\n  </a>\n  <a class=\"carousel-control-next\" href=\"#carouselExampleControls\" role=\"button\" data-slide=\"next\">\n    <span class=\"carousel-control-next-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n    <span class=\"sr-only\">Next</span>\n  </a>\n</div>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"23b8cdff60e4b758cc7a","html":"\n<div id=\"carouselExampleIndicators\" class=\"carousel slide\" data-ride=\"carousel\">\n  <ol class=\"carousel-indicators\">\n    <li data-target=\"#carouselExampleIndicators\" data-slide-to=\"0\" class=\"active\"></li>\n    <li data-target=\"#carouselExampleIndicators\" data-slide-to=\"1\"></li>\n    <li data-target=\"#carouselExampleIndicators\" data-slide-to=\"2\"></li>\n  </ol>\n  <div class=\"carousel-inner\">\n    <div class=\"carousel-item active\">\n      <img class=\"d-block w-100\" data-src=\"holder.js/800x400?auto=yes&amp;bg=777&amp;fg=555&amp;text=First slide\" alt=\"First slide\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"carousel-item\">\n      <img class=\"d-block w-100\" data-src=\"holder.js/800x400?auto=yes&amp;bg=666&amp;fg=444&amp;text=Second slide\" alt=\"Second slide\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"carousel-item\">\n      <img class=\"d-block w-100\" data-src=\"holder.js/800x400?auto=yes&amp;bg=555&amp;fg=333&amp;text=Third slide\" alt=\"Third slide\">\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <a class=\"carousel-control-prev\" href=\"#carouselExampleIndicators\" role=\"button\" data-slide=\"prev\">\n    <span class=\"carousel-control-prev-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n    <span class=\"sr-only\">Previous</span>\n  </a>\n  <a class=\"carousel-control-next\" href=\"#carouselExampleIndicators\" role=\"button\" data-slide=\"next\">\n    <span class=\"carousel-control-next-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>\n    <span class=\"sr-only\">Next</span>\n  </a>\n</div>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"25e5260631ae69fd7429","html":"\n  <div id=\"carouselExampleCaptions\" class=\"carousel slide\" data-ride=\"carousel\">\n    <ol class=\"carousel-indicators\">\n      <li data-target=\"#carouselExampleCaptions\" data-slide-to=\"0\" class=\"active\"></li>\n      <li data-target=\"#carouselExampleCaptions\" data-slide-to=\"1\"></li>\n      <li data-target=\"#carouselExampleCaptions\" data-slide-to=\"2\"></li>\n    </ol>\n    <div class=\"carousel-inner\">\n      <div class=\"carousel-item active\">\n        <img class=\"d-block w-100\" data-src=\"holder.js/800x400?auto=yes&amp;bg=777&amp;fg=555&amp;text=First slide\" alt=\"First slide\">\n        <div class=\"carousel-caption d-none d-md-block\">\n          <h5>First slide label</h5>\n          <p>Nulla vitae elit libero, a pharetra augue mollis interdum.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"carousel-item\">\n        <img class=\"d-block w-100\" data-